Launch was Monday 2026-10-12 at 09:00 Pacific in 38 countries. Here is the week.

## Launch week
- **Monday:** the login queue peaked at 22,000 players at 14:20. The team added auth capacity.
- **Tuesday:** hotfix 1.0.1 shipped. It fixed a launch crash on Android 12 devices and lifted crash-free sessions from 97.6 to 99.0 percent.
- **Wednesday:** server capacity doubled to 120 game servers.
- **Thursday:** the store featured the game in 14 countries.
- **Friday:** the first weekend event was announced for 2026-10-17.

